{"id":"4970","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4970_main_haze_lithometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>干燥的东北季风为中国广东沿海地区带来了总体上晴朗但又有霾的天气。在拍摄这张照片时，霾使得香港国际机场的能见度降低至1900米。</p>\n<p>霾是悬浮在空气中的极小且干燥的颗粒。当光线被霾粒子散射时，远处明亮的物体（在这种情况下，为太阳和周围明亮的天空）呈现黄色或微红色。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Man Yi Mak","location":"中国香港赤鱲角","latitude":"纬度: 22° 18' 55'' N","longitude":"经度: 113° 55' 22'' E","date":"12 February 2015 0752 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.12.1.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.12.1.1"},{"src":"/images/compressed/syn/4970_syn_haze_lithometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"></div>","copyright":"© 香港特别行政区政府","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/upper/4970_upper_haze_lithometeors.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"></div>","copyright":"© 香港特别行政区政府","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4831_main_haze_lithometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>雾霾是空气中悬浮的极小且干燥的颗粒，肉眼看不到，并且非常多使空气呈现乳白色外观。</p>\n<p>在该图中，雾度逐渐模糊了距离相机更远的连续山坡的细节。雾霾是由一般污染和小篝火产生的烟雾造成的，这些篝火在尼泊尔冬季期间在避风中央山谷持续燃烧若干天。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Frank Le Blancq","location":"尼泊尔Darechok，Kurintar","latitude":"纬度: 27° 52' 27'' N","longitude":"经度: 84° 36' 58'' E","date":"10 January 2015 1406 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.12.1.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.12.1.1"},{"src":"/images/compressed/4699_main_smoke-from-a-forest-fire_lithometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>在这张照片中，能见度降低（约2公里）是由于瑞典最严重的一次森林大火造成烟雾进入大气。烟雾是悬浮在空气中因燃烧产生的小颗粒。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Hans Östlund","location":"瑞典Avesta SV","latitude":"纬度: 60° 5' 54'' N","longitude":"经度: 16° 18' 13'' E","date":"05 August 2014 1913 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.12.1.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.12.1.3"}]}]}